Universal Economic Protocol (UEP)
Public Testnet + Digital Marketplace reference release, with research labs

Copyright and licensing are governed by LICENSE.

This repository is the public evaluation release of the UEP project. It contains
the local testnet reference implementation, the Digital Marketplace and IoT/M2M
service layer, and the project's experimental research labs (src/lab, src/agent,
the service/API lab in src/service and uep-core). It does not contain private
credentials, keys, infrastructure configuration or unpublished assessment
material (see PUBLIC-SCOPE.md).

The Node.js reference layer has no runtime npm dependencies. The Rust research
crates under uep-core depend on third-party crates from crates.io (for example
the arkworks libraries), which are fetched at build time and remain subject to
their respective licenses; see each crate's Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock.

